{
  "abstract": "We present the results of a formation experiment for the reactions K\u00b1p\u2192\u03a3\u00b1\u03c0\u00b1 in the c.m.s. energy between 2200 and 2436 MeV with a total statistics of 10 ev/\u03bcb. A partial-wave analysis including these new data gives evidence for the existence of three resonances in theD15,G19 andH09 states and confirms the existence of anF05 state.",
